WEBVTT

01:58.030 --> 01:59.660
<b>All right, Honey.</b>

01:59.740 --> 02:01.660
<b>That bank's got a rock-solid safe,</b>

02:01.950 --> 02:04.950
<b>a rock-solid security system,
and rock-solid guards.</b>

02:05.040 --> 02:07.790
<b>The whole shebang.
It's literally impenetrable.</b>

02:08.120 --> 02:10.750
<b>Nobody's ever been able to break in.</b>

02:10.830 --> 02:13.250
<b>Great, so how are we supposed to rob it?</b>

02:13.590 --> 02:16.090
<b>Who knows! That's the challenge!</b>

02:16.170 --> 02:18.260
<b>If we botch this
like all the other idiots,</b>

02:18.340 --> 02:20.930
<b>then we'll be stuck
behind bars in no time.</b>

02:21.010 --> 02:24.430
<b>So, Honey, how would you approach it?</b>

02:26.350 --> 02:28.600
<b>Like, don't bother and just give up?</b>

02:29.730 --> 02:33.020
<b>You're a smart cookie, Honey!
That is an option.</b>

02:34.570 --> 02:37.990
<b>But... that's not how I roll.</b>

02:38.190 --> 02:42.280
<b>Present me with an impenetrable bank
and I break into it.</b>

02:42.490 --> 02:45.200
<b>Not for the money, of course.</b>

02:45.290 --> 02:48.410
<b>But because it's never been done before.</b>

02:48.710 --> 02:50.170
<b>Just think of the thrill.</b>

02:50.500 --> 02:53.710
<b>You and I are going to make
a laughing-stock of it.</b>

02:55.500 --> 02:58.970
<b>I knew you weren't like all those other
brainless dummies</b>

02:59.050 --> 03:00.840
<b>out on the streets, Puddin'.</b>

03:01.550 --> 03:03.970
<b>This is my kinda date!</b>

03:04.930 --> 03:06.060
<b>Guess what?</b>

03:06.310 --> 03:09.100
<b>I've found a way to crack it wide open.</b>

03:12.060 --> 03:13.650
<b>And how's that?</b>

03:15.400 --> 03:17.280
<b>It's simple, really...</b>

03:23.990 --> 03:26.950
<b>Hard to believe they built all that
in just one night.</b>

03:27.040 --> 03:29.000
<b>Ugh! We're already short on time as it is!</b>

03:29.500 --> 03:32.870
<b>They're gonna do every damn thing they can
to stop us from resetting our bombs, huh?</b>

03:33.000 --> 03:34.580
<b>Stupid jerks!</b>

03:34.670 --> 03:35.960
<b>Well, it's working.</b>

03:36.290 --> 03:38.210
<b>I really must hand it to them.</b>

03:38.300 --> 03:40.170
<b>A stage like that would be suitable
for something like</b>

03:40.260 --> 03:41.970
<b>Beauty and the Beast, or maybe even-</b>

03:42.050 --> 03:44.510
<b>Our friggin' heads are
gonna go flying in a few hours.</b>

03:44.800 --> 03:46.010
<b>Get serious!</b>

03:47.970 --> 03:49.770
<b>Aw. Me need those.</b>

03:50.060 --> 03:51.480
<b>Take a good look.</b>

03:54.190 --> 03:56.940
<b>They've got those damn elves
all over the place.</b>

03:57.020 --> 03:58.150
<b>There's no way in.</b>

03:58.230 --> 04:00.610
<b>Yeah, this is gonna be a pain in the ass.</b>

04:00.940 --> 04:04.410
<b>We're going to get caught if we just
rush in there without a good plan.</b>

04:04.490 --> 04:07.030
<b>So, listen up,
nobody better jump the gun this time!</b>

04:08.540 --> 04:10.580
<b>Clayface, can you make a map?</b>

04:11.200 --> 04:14.210
<b>That's a silly question.
Who do you think you're talking to?</b>

04:14.460 --> 04:15.710
<b>Behold!</b>

04:18.960 --> 04:20.210
<b>I'll be damned!</b>

04:21.590 --> 04:22.590
<b>Okay.</b>

04:23.050 --> 04:26.180
<b>From what I could see, there are soldiers
posted from here to here.</b>

04:26.260 --> 04:29.140
<b>And they're lined up side by side
with no space to sneak through.</b>

04:30.220 --> 04:32.680
<b>Oh? Your precision is impressive.</b>

04:32.770 --> 04:34.850
<b>Soldiers are trained
to be precise, no matter...</b>

04:34.940 --> 04:36.350
<b>-Hey, don't pretend you know me.
-how crooked they become later.</b>

04:36.730 --> 04:38.860
<b>I was crooked before
I joined the military.</b>

04:39.440 --> 04:40.480
<b>I bet.</b>

04:41.740 --> 04:42.900
<b>What's the matter?</b>

04:42.990 --> 04:44.150
<b>Look over there!</b>

04:46.320 --> 04:49.120
<b>Oh, it's her.
The bitch who helped Ratcatcher.</b>

04:49.200 --> 04:52.040
<b>I had heard she was leading their group,
but I still can't believe it.</b>

04:52.120 --> 04:54.330
<b>Things just got a whole lot tougher.</b>

04:54.660 --> 04:59.590
<b>We can't kill that egghead
without luring her away from him first.</b>

04:59.670 --> 05:02.170
<b>Then why don't we just beat the hell
out of the mad scientist</b>

05:02.260 --> 05:04.510
<b>and that sword whore at the same time?</b>

05:04.670 --> 05:06.630
<b>Two shitty birds with one stone!</b>

05:06.760 --> 05:09.720
<b>Plus, I can get my revenge!
It's the perfect plan!</b>

05:09.930 --> 05:12.220
<b>If only it were that simple.</b>

05:15.100 --> 05:16.640
<b>Jeez! What do you want?!</b>

05:24.280 --> 05:25.700
<b>Me want see too.</b>

05:27.110 --> 05:28.450
<b>Seriously, you guys?</b>

05:29.990 --> 05:33.700
<b>So, how exactly are we gonna
break into the impenetrable fortress?</b>

05:34.000 --> 05:38.210
<b>Based on what he said last time,
all of the soldiers' brains are connected.</b>

05:38.380 --> 05:42.170
<b>Although, normally, the strain from that
should have fried their brains to a crisp.</b>

05:42.250 --> 05:45.510
<b>His "Thinking Cap"
is what makes it possible.</b>

05:45.670 --> 05:48.590
<b>Which means we need to find a way
to get it off him.</b>

06:01.900 --> 06:05.070
<b>Impregnable, impregnable...</b>

06:09.360 --> 06:10.530
<b>Hey, I've got it!</b>

06:10.820 --> 06:13.660
<b>So this one time,
Puddin' and I robbed a bank.</b>

06:13.740 --> 06:16.830
<b>And cracked a safe that was
kept under super tough security.</b>

06:17.120 --> 06:19.420
<b>Can you guess how we did it?</b>

06:19.620 --> 06:21.580
<b>What is this? Bragging time?</b>

06:21.710 --> 06:24.750
<b>You figured it out with skills that
you accumulated in a training montage?</b>

06:24.840 --> 06:26.800
<b>Like how it goes in the comics.</b>

06:27.090 --> 06:29.470
<b>Hey! I'm being serious here!</b>

06:33.890 --> 06:36.600
<b>Anyways, the point is that the safe,
the security system,</b>

06:36.730 --> 06:38.270
<b>and the guards aren't even important!</b>

06:38.350 --> 06:39.730
<b>It's the people who matter.</b>

06:40.020 --> 06:43.150
<b>So all we gotta do is
threaten the guy who has the keys.</b>

06:43.440 --> 06:44.940
<b>In other words...</b>

06:46.070 --> 06:47.360
<b>Very nice.</b>

06:47.440 --> 06:49.570
<b>Now we have the last piece of the puzzle.</b>

06:50.160 --> 06:52.870
<b>Why didn't I think of that myself?</b>

06:53.410 --> 06:57.500
<b>I absolutely hate that smirk on your face,
but it does get me excited!</b>

06:59.330 --> 07:01.500
<b>Here's how this is gonna go.</b>

07:03.710 --> 07:04.710
<b>For starters,</b>

07:04.790 --> 07:09.630
<b>Harley, King Shark, Clayface, and I
will approach the fortress from the back.</b>

07:09.760 --> 07:12.430
<b>For crying out loud! This is humiliating!</b>

07:12.760 --> 07:14.100
<b>-Keep it down!
-I'm not a toy, dammit!</b>

07:14.180 --> 07:15.260
<b>How dare you do this to-</b>

07:16.060 --> 07:17.770
<b>You better not mess this up.</b>

07:17.850 --> 07:21.390
<b>Break a leg out there, Nana.
Oh, and remember not to eat this guy.</b>

07:21.480 --> 07:25.020
<b>He clay. Not eat 'cause taste bad.</b>

07:25.320 --> 07:28.030
<b>Me carry him. Do good job.</b>

07:28.110 --> 07:29.530
<b>Listen here, Nanaue!</b>

07:29.820 --> 07:32.110
<b>I'm going to tell you one last time!</b>

07:32.200 --> 07:34.530
<b>-What?
-W-well...</b>

07:34.820 --> 07:36.530
<b>Water is bad for me!</b>

07:36.620 --> 07:38.830
<b>Clay may be wet, but it's not water!</b>

07:39.120 --> 07:40.870
<b>So don't soak me in the water!</b>

07:41.210 --> 07:42.250
<b>No matter what!</b>

07:42.580 --> 07:43.670
<b>Are we clear?!</b>

07:43.790 --> 07:44.920
<b>Got it.</b>

07:45.710 --> 07:46.880
<b>Me dive now, okay?</b>

07:46.960 --> 07:48.000
<b>Son of a bitch!</b>

07:48.090 --> 07:50.050
<b>Did you hear a word I said?!</b>

07:50.510 --> 07:52.590
<b>Hey, stop! Dammit!</b>

07:54.010 --> 07:56.050
<b>Hopefully there'll still be
some of him left.</b>

07:56.140 --> 07:58.010
<b>-Bye-bye.
-Let's move.</b>

07:58.850 --> 08:02.350
<b>While King Shark takes
Clayface over to the fortress</b>

08:02.640 --> 08:06.230
<b>Colonel Flag and Deadshot
will head for the front gate</b>

08:06.310 --> 08:07.820
<b>and wait for the signal.</b>

08:08.440 --> 08:09.480
<b>After you see the signal,</b>

08:09.820 --> 08:13.740
<b>Colonel Flag will attack and
lure the elves to the hut located here.</b>

08:15.700 --> 08:17.910
<b>You don't want me to attack?</b>

08:17.990 --> 08:19.240
<b>No, Deadshot.</b>

08:19.330 --> 08:22.040
<b>We need you to keep an eye
on what's happening inside the fortress.</b>

08:22.790 --> 08:24.670
<b>Take command of the infiltration team.</b>

08:25.000 --> 08:26.790
<b>Make sure they don't get caught.</b>

08:27.340 --> 08:29.420
<b>You're not the boss of me, jackass!</b>

08:37.010 --> 08:40.600
<b>So, when's this signal coming?</b>

08:42.980 --> 08:46.650
<b>Uh, actually... did we even decide
what the signal would be?</b>

08:52.860 --> 08:54.240
<b>-Go now!
-What?!</b>

08:54.320 --> 08:56.200
<b>That was the signal! Move your ass!</b>

09:02.870 --> 09:04.000
<b>Aw jeez!</b>

09:04.080 --> 09:06.540
<b>Come and get it! I'm over here!</b>

09:07.880 --> 09:09.750
<b>I'm enjoying the hell outta this.</b>

09:13.340 --> 09:14.470
<b>All right.</b>

09:14.670 --> 09:16.130
<b>Time to get started!</b>

09:31.150 --> 09:33.030
<b>It's about time.</b>

09:33.400 --> 09:35.450
<b>Go ahead and try
whatever strategy you want.</b>

09:35.530 --> 09:36.990
<b>This fortress will never fall.</b>

09:37.070 --> 09:39.320
<b>So, will you attack me with numbers?
Or weapons?</b>

09:39.620 --> 09:43.830
<b>Or perhaps some sort
of new metahuman power?</b>

09:47.670 --> 09:50.170
<b>Summon her! There's work to do!</b>

09:51.590 --> 09:52.960
<b>You're next, Clayface.</b>

09:53.550 --> 09:56.300
<b>After you hear the signal,
start working your magic.</b>

10:10.360 --> 10:11.820
<b>H-hey there...</b>

10:12.730 --> 10:14.570
<b>You needed me for something?</b>

10:15.650 --> 10:18.740
<b>Ah, yes... that's right!</b>

10:21.830 --> 10:23.160
<b>Then get to the point.</b>

10:23.240 --> 10:24.240
<b>The point?</b>

10:25.080 --> 10:27.790
<b>Uh, well, you see...</b>

10:29.960 --> 10:33.460
<b>I wanted to have a discussion with you
regarding the brain's structure.</b>

10:33.550 --> 10:36.340
<b>Will you join me over in that lab?</b>

10:36.420 --> 10:37.800
<b>There's something
I would like to show you.</b>

10:38.130 --> 10:41.340
<b>You could stand to benefit from ruminating
about intelligence once in a while.</b>

10:41.430 --> 10:43.140
<b>Because spending too much time staring at</b>

10:43.220 --> 10:45.310
<b>-Clayface will transform himself into
-your sword will turn your brain to metal.</b>

10:45.390 --> 10:47.230
<b>Thinker and keep Katana distracted,</b>

10:47.480 --> 10:51.730
<b>while Harley and I kidnap
one of the elves to imprison in the hut.</b>

10:51.810 --> 10:53.400
<b>How are we going to lure one in?</b>

10:53.480 --> 10:56.190
<b>I'll disguise myself as an elf.
Should be simple.</b>

10:56.480 --> 10:57.530
<b>Huh?</b>

10:57.610 --> 11:00.450
<b>Real friggin' funny.
You can't seriously think-</b>

11:06.240 --> 11:08.620
<b>Whoa! THAT's what you look like?!</b>

11:09.290 --> 11:10.920
<b>See? They'll never catch on.</b>

11:11.000 --> 11:13.500
<b>Wait, hold on.
Go take a good look in the mirror, pal.</b>

11:13.590 --> 11:16.460
<b>'Cause there's no way in hell a buff mofo
like you can pass for an elf!</b>

11:16.670 --> 11:17.710
<b>Oh, come on...</b>

11:18.010 --> 11:20.880
<b>Somebody wake Nanaue up!
Change of plans!</b>

11:36.440 --> 11:37.610
<b>I see.</b>

11:37.690 --> 11:39.990
<b>So this is the telepathy device, huh?</b>

11:51.250 --> 11:55.670
<b>I've heard all your brains
are connected as a single unit.</b>

11:56.540 --> 12:00.550
<b>That makes you easy to command.
The perfect army.</b>

12:00.630 --> 12:02.090
<b>But I'm curious!</b>

12:02.180 --> 12:03.930
<b>Do all of you...</b>

12:04.220 --> 12:08.970
<b>have enough integrity not to
crack under intense pain and fear?</b>

12:14.310 --> 12:17.440
<b>Nana, don't eat him! Stop it!</b>

12:28.870 --> 12:30.370
<b>What are you fools doing?!</b>

12:30.450 --> 12:34.330
<b>Go to the soldier whose frequency
is the most out of whack!</b>

12:49.810 --> 12:51.980
<b>Time to kick some ass, Nana.</b>

12:52.060 --> 12:53.100
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:56.440 --> 12:58.440
<b>Seems like everything's going smoothly.</b>

13:08.740 --> 13:10.910
<b>Keep it coming, suckers!</b>

13:17.040 --> 13:18.250
<b>There's the signal.</b>

13:18.340 --> 13:21.050
<b>Nana! Arty! Play nice, okay?</b>

13:30.470 --> 13:32.310
<b>Brainless fools! What are they doing?!</b>

13:32.600 --> 13:35.560
<b>There's no army waiting
to ambush us outside the fortress,</b>

13:35.850 --> 13:37.980
<b>and no magical weapons from the Kingdom!</b>

13:38.060 --> 13:40.940
<b>Not even a new metahuman power!</b>

13:41.270 --> 13:43.900
<b>So, what the hell are they up to?!</b>

13:46.490 --> 13:48.820
<b>Hi there, Mr. Egghead!</b>

13:48.910 --> 13:51.330
<b>Is that outfit trendy
over in the Empire or what?</b>

13:51.410 --> 13:52.620
<b>It's you...</b>

13:53.660 --> 13:56.040
<b>'Cause it looks like total shit to me.</b>

14:01.290 --> 14:04.510
<b>Well, now. This is amusing.</b>

14:04.800 --> 14:09.840
<b>Your plan is so utterly idiotic I never
bothered to consider it a possibility.</b>

14:10.180 --> 14:13.520
<b>I guess I overestimated you
a little too much.</b>

14:13.600 --> 14:16.060
<b>Sounds to me like you're just butthurt
because you couldn't</b>

14:16.180 --> 14:17.390
<b>find a way to cheat and win.</b>

14:17.480 --> 14:18.940
<b>Where is Katana?</b>

14:19.020 --> 14:20.310
<b>She's not coming.</b>

14:20.610 --> 14:22.900
<b>'Cause we've got you keeping her busy.</b>

14:23.980 --> 14:26.610
<b>The one time I need her and she's useless.</b>

14:26.900 --> 14:29.160
<b>Enough chit-chat.</b>

14:29.240 --> 14:30.700
<b>We gotta settle this shit fast.</b>

14:31.620 --> 14:34.290
<b>'Cause nobody wants their head
going kablooey!</b>

14:37.410 --> 14:39.210
<b>Ready for the pain?</b>

14:55.140 --> 14:56.850
<b>Ow! Hey!</b>

14:56.930 --> 14:59.810
<b>Stop predicting all my moves!
How am I supposed to hit you?!</b>

15:00.100 --> 15:03.690
<b>You simple-minded fool.
I'm not just going to let you hit me.</b>

15:04.360 --> 15:05.610
<b>Screw it!</b>

15:13.780 --> 15:15.580
<b>Eh?</b>

15:15.660 --> 15:17.080
<b>Look at all the birdies!</b>

15:17.700 --> 15:20.080
<b>Heh. How dumb can you get?</b>

15:28.130 --> 15:29.920
<b>Look at that big-ass head!</b>

15:33.890 --> 15:36.890
<b>You intentionally took a hit to the head
so I can't read what you're thinking.</b>

15:36.970 --> 15:38.560
<b>But that only works on a surface level.</b>

15:38.640 --> 15:40.640
<b>I can always just dive deeper
into your head!</b>

15:40.730 --> 15:41.980
<b>Go ahead and try!</b>

15:42.190 --> 15:45.070
<b>Scramble my brain like you did
to everybody else!</b>

15:46.190 --> 15:47.570
<b>Stupid bitch!</b>

15:47.860 --> 15:51.450
<b>You're going to regret this!</b>

16:02.290 --> 16:04.750
<b>So, these are Harley Quinn's...</b>

16:05.630 --> 16:09.670
<b>No, Harleen Quinzel's memories?</b>

16:12.130 --> 16:14.430
<b>She was a psychiatrist
at Arkham Asylum</b>

16:14.510 --> 16:17.060
<b>with a bright future
ahead of her, but then...</b>

16:17.350 --> 16:19.310
<b>Hey, Doctor.</b>

16:20.640 --> 16:22.560
<b>Got a question for ya.</b>

16:25.480 --> 16:30.240
<b>If you really love me,
would you die for me?</b>

16:38.870 --> 16:41.750
<b>C'mon. Prove it.</b>

16:42.660 --> 16:46.380
<b>Fall down and swear
an eternal oath to me.</b>

16:49.000 --> 16:50.130
<b>Harley?!</b>

16:50.210 --> 16:51.380
<b>Oh, don't have a fit.</b>

16:51.460 --> 16:54.720
<b>You'll be okay as long as
you love Puddin'.</b>

16:54.800 --> 16:56.340
<b>-Ain't that right?
-What's going on?</b>

16:56.430 --> 16:59.260
<b>How are you doing this?!
It shouldn't be possible!</b>

16:59.560 --> 17:01.060
<b>So, which side are you on?</b>

17:01.140 --> 17:03.270
<b>We'll find out once he takes the fall.</b>

17:03.350 --> 17:04.480
<b>-Do it!
-Wait!</b>

17:04.560 --> 17:07.360
<b>Wait! Please don't!</b>

17:09.190 --> 17:12.570
<b>NO!</b>

17:27.750 --> 17:29.590
<b>Did you have a nice dream?</b>

17:44.890 --> 17:46.100
<b>It over now?</b>

17:46.190 --> 17:48.690
<b>Hot damn! Look at this bloodbath.</b>

17:57.990 --> 17:59.410
<b>What are you giving me that look for?</b>

17:59.660 --> 18:02.990
<b>You knew this was the plan all along.</b>

18:06.670 --> 18:10.250
<b>Guess I can't complain
about being labeled a villain now.</b>

18:10.420 --> 18:11.800
<b>Let's get going.</b>

18:12.130 --> 18:14.510
<b>We don't have much longer
until the bombs go off.</b>

18:36.190 --> 18:37.280
<b>Now you show up?</b>

18:37.360 --> 18:39.820
<b>For the guy known as being
the "smartest" man in the world...</b>

18:40.280 --> 18:42.080
<b>you didn't amount to very much.</b>

18:58.800 --> 19:00.970
<b>Ugh, I'm soaked to the bone.</b>

19:18.780 --> 19:20.110
<b>What the hell?</b>

19:20.280 --> 19:21.780
<b>Aren't you on the same side?!</b>

19:22.200 --> 19:24.530
<b>He was only worth
keeping around for his cap.</b>

19:24.620 --> 19:25.660
<b>So this is perfect.</b>

19:28.410 --> 19:29.870
<b>I'll give you credit.</b>

19:30.080 --> 19:32.500
<b>That was a pretty good plan.</b>

19:36.090 --> 19:37.210
<b>Clay!</b>

19:54.190 --> 19:55.270
<b>Not again!</b>

19:57.650 --> 19:58.860
<b>This bitch really pisses me off!</b>

19:59.110 --> 20:00.150
<b>Hey, Clay!</b>

20:00.240 --> 20:01.990
<b>You gonna sit there like sludge or what?</b>

20:03.070 --> 20:06.950
<b>I can't proclaim to be a gentleman
if I don't step up...</b>

20:07.040 --> 20:08.790
<b>when a lady needs me!</b>

21:02.260 --> 21:05.680
<b>Wow! So, you do have a face under there.</b>

21:06.590 --> 21:08.680
<b>You're a fascinating woman...</b>

21:10.100 --> 21:11.640
<b>Harley.</b>

21:15.600 --> 21:16.980
<b>Well, thanks.</b>

21:30.620 --> 21:31.830
<b>Not so fast!</b>

21:49.010 --> 21:50.060
<b>That jerk!</b>

21:50.140 --> 21:51.220
<b>Stop!</b>

21:52.970 --> 21:55.270
<b>Chasing them now
would be a waste of energy.</b>

21:57.810 --> 22:00.520
<b>We'll have to get our revenge another day.</b>

22:04.530 --> 22:08.450
<b>It sucks that she got away,
but at least we still have our heads.</b>

22:08.530 --> 22:12.120
<b>Oh, yeah! I totally forgot about that!
Lucky us!</b>

22:12.200 --> 22:13.870
<b>I'm friggin' sick and tired</b>

22:13.950 --> 22:16.580
<b>of having to rush all the time
'cause of these stupid bombs.</b>

22:16.920 --> 22:18.830
<b>Can't you do something about 'em?</b>

22:18.920 --> 22:20.750
<b>Don't look at me. It's out of my hands.</b>

22:20.880 --> 22:22.000
<b>Shit.</b>

22:23.880 --> 22:25.010
<b>All right.</b>

22:25.090 --> 22:27.930
<b>Time for us to report the good news.</b>

22:28.260 --> 22:29.260
<b>Report?</b>

22:29.340 --> 22:31.680
<b>To who? And how?</b>

22:42.070 --> 22:45.240
<b>Keep it up, Arty! You're almost there!</b>

22:47.950 --> 22:50.320
<b>Wow! Way to go, Arty!</b>

22:50.410 --> 22:52.080
<b>A round of applause!</b>

22:52.160 --> 22:54.540
<b>Pretty good work for his first mission.</b>

23:13.810 --> 23:15.640
<b>What did you say?!</b>

23:16.100 --> 23:17.640
<b>Well, um...</b>

23:18.140 --> 23:22.060
<b>one of the Empire's generals and his elf
forces that established a new fortress...</b>

23:23.520 --> 23:26.230
<b>have all been defeated per a report.</b>

23:26.320 --> 23:28.950
<b>That escaped gang of hooligans
from the other world</b>

23:29.030 --> 23:30.700
<b>were apparently responsible for it.</b>

23:33.120 --> 23:34.330
<b>Cecil!</b>

23:42.250 --> 23:43.590
<b>Dispatch our troops!</b>

23:43.670 --> 23:45.590
<b>Bring those bastards here to the castle!</b>

23:45.670 --> 23:48.970
<b>And cut their heads off
if they try to resist!</b>

23:49.300 --> 23:51.050
<b>-Y-yes, Your Majesty.
-Y-yes, Your Majesty.</b>

23:52.590 --> 23:54.510
<b>Mother...?</b>
